==Notes==
* [[Barista Cousin]] can spawn on the Great Tree, on a rock near the tree.
* [[Elite Pirates]] can spawn on the Great Tree.
* The "Banana" fruit for the [[Hungry Man Quest]] spawns on the Great Tree.
* When climbing the Great Tree, if players use mobility moves at the top leafy part (where the purple platform is), a camera glitch may cause them to go backwards instead. It is recommended to go in first person, with a [[flight]] move, or climb the tree entirely with [[Air Jump|air jumps]].
* If the player does not have any [[Blox Fruits]] with mobility, it is recommended to use [[Dragon Talon]] to climb the Great tree, As the {{Ability|Dragon Talon|Z}} and upgraded {{Ability|Dragon Talon|X}} can be used to fly up to the leaves. [[Electric Claw]] is a decent alternative if the player does not have upgraded Dragon talon.  
** It is possible to climb the Great Tree without special fruits, however it is quite difficult to do so.
** At the top of the Great Tree, the [[Mysterious Force]] [[NPCs|NPC]] can be found.

